#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:7
msgid ""
"Select your profile picture and select **Profile** to manage the details "
"of your Mattermost profile, including your name, username, nickname, "
"email, and profile picture."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:9
msgid ""
"Your Mattermost system admin may :doc:`define custom user profile fields "
"</administration-guide/manage/admin/user-attributes>` that you can "
"personalize. Additionally, some of your profile information may be pulled"
" from another source, which means you won't be able to modify it in "
"Mattermost. Contact your Mattermost system admin for assistance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:12
msgid "**Profile setting**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:12
msgid "**Description**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:14
msgid "Full, first, and last name"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:14
msgid ""
"Your name appears in the direct messages member list and team management "
"modal. By default, you'll receive mention notifications when someone "
"types your first name in a message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:18
msgid "Username"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:18
msgid ""
"Usernames are unique identifiers appearing next to all posts. Usernames "
"must begin with a letter, and contain between 3 to 22 lowercase "
"characters made up of numbers, letters, and the symbols ``.``, ``-``, and"
" ``_``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:23
msgid ""
"Pick something easy for teammates to recognize and recall. By default, "
"you'll receive mention notifications when someone types your username. "
"Changing your username won't change your existing @mentions in sent "
"messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:27
msgid "Nickname"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:27
msgid ""
"(Optional) Nicknames appear in the direct messages member list and team "
"management modal. Your nickname can be up to 64 characters long."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:30
msgid ""
"You won't be notified when someone types your nickname unless you add "
"your nickname to the list of **Keywords that Trigger Notifications** as a"
" :ref:`notification preference <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"mentions-keywords-notifications:customize notification keywords>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:34
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.8, nicknames display in :doc:`threaded discussions "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/organize-conversations>` when available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:37
msgid "Position"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:37
msgid ""
"(Optional) Position can be used to describe your role or job title. Your "
"position appears in the profile popup that displays when you select a "
"user's name in the center channel or right-hand sidebar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:41
msgid "Email"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:41
msgid "Email is used for signing in, notifications, and password reset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:43
msgid "Profile picture"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:43
msgid ""
"Profile pictures appear next to all posts, and you can select your "
"profile picture to access your profile settings. To change your profile "
"picture:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:46
msgid "**Using the web or the desktop app**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:48
msgid "Select **Edit** next to the **Profile Picture** option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:49
msgid ""
"Choose **Select**, pick the profile image you want to use, and select "
"**Save**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:51
msgid "**Using the mobile app**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:53
msgid "Tap your current profile picture."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:54
msgid "Take a photo using your device, or select an image to use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-profile.rst:58
msgid ""
"For best results, choose an image that's at least 128 x 128 pixels in "
"size. Supported image formats include: BMP, JPG, JPEG, and PNG. GIF isn't"
" supported."
msgstr ""

